# The defect classes this distribution DECLARES (mtools:W629), planted one at a time by the
# `:mutants` runner: <module>|<name>|<pattern>|<replacement>|<scope>. A line that stops
# matching is a STALE declaration and fails the grid as UNAPPLIED.
src/mikemol/otlp/staleness.py|identical-copy-reported|    if installed\.read_bytes\(\) == source\.read_bytes\(\):|    if False:|def=stale
src/mikemol/otlp/staleness.py|missing-install-compared|    if source is None or not installed\.is_file\(\):|    if source is None:|def=stale
